SuperChunk
==========

SuperChunk is a single, standalone NeoForge 1.21.1 mod created by merging the
source of several existing Minecraft mods, plus an original GPU/OpenCL worldgen
offload written from scratch.

Because it incorporates LGPL-3.0 licensed source, the COMBINED WORK as a whole is
distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3.0 (see the
LICENSE file). The MIT-licensed components below remain under the MIT License; the
full MIT permission notice required by that license is reproduced at the end of
this file.

