FlowSched — task scheduler vendored with C2ME (com.ishland.flowsched).
    Upstream:  ishland / FlowSched
    License:   MIT
    Copyright: (c) 2023 ishland

VMP (Very Many Players) — area-based player chunk watching/sending.
    Upstream:  https://github.com/RelativityMC/VMP-fabric
    License:   MIT
    Copyright: (c) 2021-2023 ishland

Lithium — general game-logic optimizations.
    Upstream:  https://github.com/CaffeineMC/lithium  (NeoForge port)
